{"title": "Status properties/LoseControlFriendly", "pageid": 35347, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Status_properties/LoseControlFriendly", "categories": ["Status properties"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">Status properties</a>.</div>\n<p><b>LoseControlFriendly</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Status_property\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status property\">status property</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"List_of_conditions_with_LoseControlFriendly\">List of conditions with LoseControlFriendly</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Champion_Challenge\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Champion_Challenge_(Condition)\" title=\"Champion Challenge (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Champion_Challenge_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Champion_Challenge_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Champion_Challenge_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Champion_Challenge_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Champion_Challenge_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Champion_Challenge_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Champion Challenge\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Champion_Challenge_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Champion_Challenge_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Champion_Challenge_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Champion_Challenge_(Condition)\" title=\"Champion Challenge (Condition)\">Champion Challenge</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity is compelled to attack the paladin that challenged them. Any attacks they might make against targets other than the paladin have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a>.</li>\n<li>Condition ends if the entity moves 9 m (30 ft) away from the paladin.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Compelled_Duel\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Compelled_Duel_(Condition)\" title=\"Compelled Duel (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Compelled Duel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d2/Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Compelled_Duel_(Condition)\" title=\"Compelled Duel (Condition)\">Compelled Duel</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Rolls\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Rolls\">Attack Rolls</a> against anyone but the caster.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Compelled_to_Duel\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Compelled_to_Duel_(Condition)\" title=\"Compelled to Duel (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Compelled to Duel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d2/Compelled_Duel_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Compelled_to_Duel_(Condition)\" title=\"Compelled to Duel (Condition)\">Compelled to Duel</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Rolls\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Rolls\">Attack Rolls</a> against anyone but the caster. Might start <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bleeding_(Condition)\" title=\"Bleeding (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bleeding\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bleeding_(Condition)\" title=\"Bleeding (Condition)\">Bleeding</a> if struck by the Dueller.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Gnawing_Horde\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gnawing_Horde_(Condition)\" title=\"Gnawing Horde (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Generic_Summon_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Summon_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Generic_Summon_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Summon_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Generic_Summon_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Summon_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gnawing Horde\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Generic_Summon_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Summon_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/80/Generic_Summon_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Gnawing_Horde_(Condition)\" title=\"Gnawing Horde (Condition)\">Gnawing Horde</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Ravenous Ghouls that fight alongside you.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Goaded\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Goaded_(Condition)\" title=\"Goaded (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ad/Goaded_Condition_Icon.webp/29px-Goaded_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ad/Goaded_Condition_Icon.webp/44px-Goaded_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ad/Goaded_Condition_Icon.webp/58px-Goaded_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Goaded\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ad/Goaded_Condition_Icon.webp/29px-Goaded_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"29\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ad/Goaded_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Goaded_(Condition)\" title=\"Goaded (Condition)\">Goaded</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Must attack the goading creature, if possible.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on Attack Rolls against targets other than the spellcaster.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Newborn_Zombie\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Newborn_Zombie_(Condition)\" title=\"Newborn Zombie (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Newborn Zombie\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Crawling_Gnaw_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Newborn_Zombie_(Condition)\" title=\"Newborn Zombie (Condition)\">Newborn Zombie</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Zombies born from the Crawling Gnaw cannot last. They take <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">1</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> each turn and only follow the zombie that infected them.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"On_Black_Wings\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/On_Black_Wings_(Condition)\" title=\"On Black Wings (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Hands_Off%2C_Petal_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Hands_Off%2C_Petal_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Hands_Off%2C_Petal_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Hands_Off%2C_Petal_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Hands_Off%2C_Petal_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Hands_Off%2C_Petal_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"On Black Wings\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Hands_Off%2C_Petal_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Hands_Off%2C_Petal_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6c/Hands_Off%2C_Petal_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/On_Black_Wings_(Condition)\" title=\"On Black Wings (Condition)\">On Black Wings</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>An unkindness of ravens that will act of their own accord.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715022719\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.045 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1755/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27199/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5320/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643579/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   36.526    